    "body": "> Those links used to point to tables containing resp. the characteristics, descriptors and services (name/type/number/level). I can also nolonger find those tables.\r\n\r\nWe added a version of these files to the registries repo when the Bluetooth SIG removed them from their site:\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/WebBluetoothCG/registries/blob/master/gatt_assigned_services.txt\r\n* https://github.com/WebBluetoothCG/registries/blob/master/gatt_assigned_descriptors.txt\r\n* https://github.com/WebBluetoothCG/registries/blob/master/gatt_assigned_characteristics.txt\r\n\r\nMore discussion of this was on #535.",
